 6641	55DC					    ; Destroys: AF, BC, DE, HL
 6642	55DC					    ; Notes:
 6643	55DC					    ;   - Fast path for power-of-two periods using bitmask modulo.
 6644	55DC					    ;   - Fallback path uses 16-bit frame modulo with fixed 16-iteration cost.
