 17261	8CF2					Condition_Xor:
 17262	8CF2					    ; XOR compound condition
 17263	8CF2					    ; Data format: DB subcondition_count, then N subconditions inline
 17264	8CF2					    ; Returns true if an odd number of subconditions are true.
 17265	8CF2					    ; Input: B = Entity Index, HL = Params (points to count byte)
 17266	8CF2					    ; Output: A = 1 (odd true count) or 0 (even true count), HL advanced
