 17300	8D0D					    ; Evaluates the single subcondition and inverts the result
 17301	8D0D					    ; Input: B = Entity Index, HL = Params (points to count byte)
 17302	8D0D					    ; Output: A = inverted result, HL = past subcondition data
 17303	8D0D	23				    inc hl                  ; Skip count byte (always 1)
 17304	8D0E					
